          "text": "<h2><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Every device. Every time.</span><span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\"></span></span></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Each Reprocessed ViewFlex Xtra ICE Catheter is 100% function tested before being sent back to you.<sup>1</sup>&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">See how Stryker's Sustainability Solutions (SSS) reprocessed this device in the video here.&nbsp;</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
